This directory documents my ongoing learning and practical exploration of hardware technologies relevant to Server, Storage, and Infrastructure Engineering.

Topics include CPU, RAM, motherboards, HDDs, SSDs, RAID, HBA, NIC, enterprise servers, and other essential hardware components.

Each topic will include fundamental concepts, hardware architecture, technical documentation, practical lab exercises, and troubleshooting notes to build a strong foundation in enterprise infrastructure.

Objective: To develop practical knowledge of server and storage hardware, its functionality, and its role in enterprise IT infrastructure.

